      "raw": "The below table lists the various templates available in Connect+ that you can use to create dataflows or integration workflows in the Connect+ platform.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "The below table lists the various templates available in Connect+ that you can use to create dataflows or integration workflows in the Connect+ platform.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
